    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="15">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 15</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Þonne fyrðrige Oslác eorl ⁊ eall here þe on his ealdordome wunað, þæt ðis stande, Gode to lofe ⁊ ure ealra saula to ðearfe ⁊ eallum folce to friðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Further, Earl Oslac and all the population dwelling in his earldom shall preserve the observance of this, to the praise of God, and for the good of the souls of all of us, and the security of the whole nation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Þonne fyrþrige Oslác eorl ⁊ éal here, þe on his ealdor[do]me wunað, þæt þis stande, Gode to lofe ⁊ ure ealra saula to þearfe ⁊ eallum folce to friðe.</ab>
      </div>
